  "title": "Introducing Guided Clubs on Flow Club",
  "summary": "Guided Clubs are the new coach and peer-led accountability groups within Flow Club. In these Guided Clubs, you can find likeminded people who share your specific challenge or struggle, and who are committed to making progress together with you for a few weeks. A coach or expert peer will facilitate the group, sharing methods and techniques that they've found helpful along the way.",
